{"body":"Bumps [storybook](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/tree/HEAD/code/core) from 10.6.2 to 10.6.4.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases\">storybook's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v10.6.4</h2>\n<h2>10.6.4</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Skip TypeScript loader hook registration under Jest - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36790\">#36790</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/obvious-autobuild\"><code>@​obvious-autobuild</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v10.6.3</h2>\n<h2>10.6.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Addon Vitest: Support Vitest 5 - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36671\">#36671</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/PaulMest\"><code>@​PaulMest</code></a>!</li>\n<li>Next.js: Fix app-router mock crash on Next.js 16.4 - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36588\">#36588</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/obvious-autobuild\"><code>@​obvious-autobuild</code></a>!</li>\n<li>Nextjs-Vite: Provide parentRenderTree.bfcacheId in app router mock - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36732\">#36732</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bhushan4work\"><code>@​bhushan4work</code></a>!</li>\n<li>TypeScript: Explicitly type returntype of ArgsStore#get - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36583\">#36583</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/mrginglymus\"><code>@​mrginglymus</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/next/CHANGELOG.md\">storybook's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>10.6.4</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Skip TypeScript loader hook registration under Jest - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36790\">#36790</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/obvious-autobuild\"><code>@​obvious-autobuild</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>10.6.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Addon Vitest: Support Vitest 5 - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36671\">#36671</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/PaulMest\"><code>@​PaulMest</code></a>!</li>\n<li>Next.js: Fix app-router mock crash on Next.js 16.4 - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36588\">#36588</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/obvious-autobuild\"><code>@​obvious-autobuild</code></a>!</li>\n<li>Nextjs-Vite: Provide parentRenderTree.bfcacheId in app router mock - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36732\">#36732</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bhushan4work\"><code>@​bhushan4work</code></a>!</li>\n<li>TypeScript: Explicitly type returntype of ArgsStore#get - <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/36583\">#36583</a>, thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/mrginglymus\"><code>@​mrginglymus</code></a>!</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/commit/303276dab9bfad16c0f91c6247f20d5afd5f288a\"><code>303276d</code></a> Bump version from &quot;10.6.3&quot; to &quot;10.6.4&quot; [skip ci]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/commit/13598680e9c041c865f4ddc98f9790ea61bf7642\"><code>1359868</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/tree/HEAD/code/core/issues/36790\">#36790</a> from storybookjs/fix/import-module-jest-module-regi...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/commit/9b4e295a7f994b6496cb1fdd50b436dd64925cca\"><code>9b4e295</code></a> Bump version from &quot;10.6.2&quot; to &quot;10.6.3&quot; [skip ci]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/commit/b67d31a7a57fbd96253453b6654506f48959c3ba\"><code>b67d31a</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/tree/HEAD/code/core/issues/36583\">#36583</a> from storybookjs/bill/more-type-fixes</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/commits/v10.6.4/code/core\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=storybook&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=10.6.2&new-version=10.6.4)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>","files":[{"path":"package-lock.json","additions":4,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"package.json","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefOid":"dd2b2a6b577635e3f6c37398e79e9e389421acb8","